cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use balreport, please cite this software using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "balreport: Two-group descriptive statistics and covariate balance report for Stata"
version: "1.1.0"
authors:
  - family-names: Mitsuhashi
    given-names: Toshiharu
    alias: sankyoh
    website: "https://github.com/sankyoh"
repository-code: "https://github.com/sankyoh/balreport"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - Stata
  - covariate balance
  - descriptive statistics
  - weighted quantiles
  - standardized mean difference
abstract: >-
  A standalone Stata command for two-group descriptive statistics and balance
  reporting. Continuous summaries include mean (SD) and median (Q1, Q3);
  categorical summaries include counts and percentages. Supports weighted
  quantiles, SMD, variance ratios, Excel export and configurable precision.
